# ============================================
# RL Interactive Labs - Environment Configuration
# ============================================

# No environment variables are required for deployment.
#
# The application is designed for users to provide their own
# Google Gemini API key via the UI for AI tutoring features.
#
# How users get an API key:
# 1. Visit: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Sign in with Google account
# 3. Click "Create API Key"
# 4. Enter the key in the app's API Key field
#
# Free tier limits: 15 requests per minute (RPM)

# ============================================
# Deployment
# ============================================
#
# Docker:
#   docker compose up -d --build
#
# Local development:
#   npm install && npm run dev
#
